<LegalPage title="License" description="A plain-language summary of the Flicksy license." updated="September 4, 2026">
  <p>Your one-time Flicksy purchase includes permanent access to the app and all 1.x updates. There is no subscription and no Flicksy account.</p>

  <h2>Direct purchase</h2>
  <p>A direct license may be active on up to three Macs. You can deactivate a Mac inside Flicksy to reuse that seat. Keep the license key private.</p>

  <h2>Mac App Store purchase</h2>
  <p>The Mac App Store version is sold as a paid-upfront app. Its purchase is associated with the Apple Account used to buy it and can be downloaded again from that account’s Purchased list, subject to Apple’s store terms. Flicksy does not sell or restore an in-app product. Family Sharing is not enabled.</p>

  <h2>Separate sales channels</h2>
  <p>Direct and Mac App Store purchases are separate and cannot be activated or restored across stores. Switching builds preserves compatible Flicksy app data, but it does not transfer a purchase entitlement.</p>
</LegalPage>
